start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch [3dc 2ch]x3}@ring ss@top
R2: sl@sp {3ch=dc 2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp ch]x3 ss@top
R3: ch sc@same 2sc {sc 2ch sc}@sp 3sc 5ch sk [3sc {sc 2ch sc}@sp 3sc 5ch sk]x3 ss@top fo
R4: {3ch=dc 3dc 2ch 4dc}@sp 2ch sc@sp 2ch [{4dc 2ch 4dc}@sp 2ch sc@sp 2ch]x3 ss@top
R5: 3ch=dc 3dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp 4dc 2ch dc 2ch [4dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp 4dc 2ch dc 2ch]x3 ss@top
R6: ch sc@same [[sc]>corner {sc 2ch sc}@sp]x4 [sc]>end ss@top fo
